config ESP_HOSTED_HOST_COMPAT
	bool
	default y if ESP_HOSTED_HOST_FEAT_RPC_READY
	help
	  Public esp_hosted_* API surface; thin static inline redirects to
	  the canonical eh_host_* functions. Both surfaces are publicly
	  usable; only 5 orchestration APIs are real (non-inline) symbols.
	  Auto-asserted whenever the RPC base is built.
